   "source": [
    "# 📖 Traditional vs Agent Observability\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🎯 Learning Objectives\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Understand traditional software observability\n",
    "2. Learn how agent observability differs\n",
    "3. Know what to track for agents\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## ⏱️ Time Estimate\n",
    "**~25 minutes**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🏢 Traditional Software Observability\n",
    "\n",
    "```\",
    "┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n",
    "│          TRADITIONAL SOFTWARE                              │\n",
    "├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n",
    "│                                                             │\n",
    "│  Request → [Code] → Response                              │\n",
    "│            ↓                                               │\n",
    "│  • Logs (What happened?)                                  │\n",
    "│  • Metrics (How fast? How many?)                         │\n",
    "│  • Traces (Request flow)                                 │\n",
    "│            ↓                                               │\n",
    "│  DETERMINISTIC: Same input = Same output                 │\n",
    "│  Easy to reproduce & debug                                │\n",
    "│                                                             │\n",
    "└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🤖 Agent Observability\n",
    "\n",
    "```\",
    "┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n",
    "│               AGENT SYSTEMS                                │\n",
    "├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n",
    "│                                                             │\n",
    "│  Input → [LLM] → Decision → [Tool] → Result → [LLM] → Out  │\n",
    "│            ↓           ↓           ↓                        │\n",
    "│  • Tool calls (What did agent decide?)                   │\n",
    "│  • Reasoning traces (Why did it decide?)                  │\n",
    "│  • Memory state (What does it remember?)                  │\n",
    "│  • Token usage (Cost tracking)                           │\n",
    "│            ↓                                               │\n",
    "│  PROBABILISTIC: Same input ≠ Same output (sometimes)     │\n",
    "│  Harder to reproduce & debug                             │\n",
    "│                                                             │\n",
    "└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📊 Comparison Table\n",
    "\n",
    "| Aspect | Traditional SW | Agent Systems |\n",
    "|--------|----------------|---------------|\n",
    "**| Determinism | Yes (usually) | No (LLM is probabilistic) |\n",
    "**| Reproducibility | High | Variable |\n",
    "**| Failure modes | Defined errors | Hallucinations, loops |\n",
    "**| Metrics | Latency, errors | Tool calls, token count |\n",
    "**| Debugging | Stack traces | Reasoning traces |\n",
    "**| Testing | Unit tests | Evals (special!) |\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🔑 Key Insight\n",
    "\n",
    "```\",
    "┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n",
    "│                                                             │\n",
    "│  TRADITIONAL: Logs tell you WHAT broke                   │\n",
    "│                                                             │\n",
    "│  AGENTS: Traces tell you WHY it made a choice           │\n",
    "│          AND if that choice was CORRECT                  │\n",
    "│                                                             │\n",
    "└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📦 What to Track for Agents"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
