    "print(\"└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 💡 Why Traditional Testing Doesn't Work\n",
    "\n",
    "```\",
    "┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n",
    "│         WHY AGENTS NEED DIFFERENT TESTING                   │\n",
    "├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n",
    "│                                                             │\n",
    "│  TRADITIONAL TEST:                                        │\n",
    "│  def test_add():\n",
    "│      assert add(2, 3) == 5  # Always works\n",
    "│                                                             │\n",
    "│  AGENT TEST:                                              │\n",
    "│  def test_agent():\n",
    "│      assert agent.ask(\"What's 2+2?\") == \"4\"  # May fail!\n",
    "│      # Agent might say \"3\" or \"5\" or \"The answer is 4.\"\n",
    "│      # AND it might be correct today but wrong tomorrow\n",
    "│                                                             │\n",
    "└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## ✅ Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "Key differences:\n",
    "1. **Agents are probabilistic** - same input ≠ same output\n",
    "2. **Need reasoning traces** - not just logs\n",
    "3. **Need evals** - not just tests\n",
    "4. **Track tool calls** - understand decisions\n",
    "\n",
    "This leads us to **LangSmith** for agent observability!\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🔗 Next\n",
    "**[02_introduction_to_langsmith.ipynb](02_introduction_to_langsmith.ipynb)** - LangSmith basics"
   ]
  }
